/* Embedded images (wallpaper, logos, tree/bark/leaf textures).
   Base64 data-URIs that used to be inlined in the game code. They stay as JS (not separate image/audio files)
   on purpose: that way the game also works when index.html is opened straight from disk (file://),
   where browsers block WebGL textures and fetch() from separate files. Loaded BEFORE the game code. */
window.MTA_DATA=window.MTA_DATA||{};

